578 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 452 0 R
/E (Friend, I want to talk to you for a second before you dive into these prayers.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
579 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 452 0 R
/E (Spiritual warfare is real. I know that might sound intense, but if you have been walking with God for any length of time, you already know it is true. There are seasons in life where everything seems to go wrong at once. Relationships break down. Finances get tight. Your health is challenged. Your mind feels like a battlefield. You find yourself asking God, "Why is this happening? Why does it feel like I am under attack?")
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
580 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 452 0 R
/E (The answer is simple: because you are.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
581 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 452 0 R
/E <>
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
582 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 452 0 R
/E (But here is what I need you to understand: you are not fighting for victory. You are fighting from victory. Jesus already won the war. Every battle you face in life is just the enemy trying to convince you of a defeat that has already been reversed. The resurrection settled it. The cross sealed it. And prayer activates it in your daily life.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
583 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 452 0 R
/E <>
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
584 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 452 0 R
/E (One hundred prayers. One hundred declarations. One hundred moments between you and God that have the power to shift everything.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
585 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 452 0 R
/E (Isaiah 54:17 says, "No weapon that is formed against thee shall prosper." That is not a suggestion. That is a promise. Stand on it. Pray it. Live it.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [8]
>>
