<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 457 0 R
/E (I declare that no weapon formed against me shall prosper. Not against my life, not against my well-being, not against my relationships, not against my calling, and not against my future. I thank You, Lord, that I am sealed in You and that what You cover, no enemy can touch. I go forward today fully protected, fully covered, and fully confident in Your power and love.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
