/E (God, I thank You that before I was born You had a plan for my life. Jeremiah 1:5 tells me that You knew me before You formed me in the womb and that You ordained me with a purpose. I believe that truth with everything in me. I was not an accident. I was not a mistake. I was intentionally created, specifically designed, and strategically placed on this earth for a reason that only I can fulfill.)
