/P 517 0 R
/E (God, I am going to be honest with You today. My faith feels small. The mountain in front of me feels enormous and the seed of faith in my hand feels inadequate for the task. I have been praying and it feels like the ceiling. I have been standing on promises and it feels like the promises are taking too long. I have been trying to trust and the trying feels like work. I bring all of that to You today without pretense or performance.)
/Pg 77 0 R
/K [1]
>>
