/P 518 0 R
/E (Father, I am in an unknown place right now. I cannot see what is ahead. I do not know how this situation is going to resolve, which direction I should take, or what the next season of my life is going to look like. And the unknown is uncomfortable. I am a person who likes to know. I like plans, I like clarity, I like to see the road before I walk it. But You are calling me to trust You in the dark.)
/Pg 78 0 R
/K [1]
>>
