/E (I take this moment to honor You for how You fought for me. For the times You stepped in when I had nothing left. For the moments of divine intervention I saw and for the countless ones I did not see. For the people You sent into my life at exactly the right moment. For the grace that covered me when I stumbled. For the mercy that met me when I fell. You were faithful in every single moment of this battle, and I will not let it pass without saying so out loud.)
/Pg 107 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
1313 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 547 0 R
/E (I declare that the enemy did not win. He attacked. He pressed. He tried every weapon in his arsenal. And not one of them prospered. The Word of God over my life held. The promises I stood on held. And the God I trusted held me. Victory is mine. And it belongs first to the One who won it on my behalf.)
/Pg 107 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
