1356 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 554 0 R
/E (I remember today. I remember the time You came through when I had nothing left. I remember the divine appointment that changed the direction of my life. I remember the prayer that was answered in a way I never expected but that was far better than what I had originally asked for. I remember the night You met me in the darkest moment and let me feel Your presence in a way that I have never forgotten. Heaven moved.)
/Pg 114 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
1357 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 554 0 R
/E (And knowing that heaven has moved for me before gives me absolute confidence that it will move again. The same God. The same faithfulness. The same love. You have not changed and Your track record in my life is proof of who You are. I pray today from the foundation of everything I have already seen You do, and I bring that history of Your faithfulness into every request I make for the future.)
/Pg 114 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
1358 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 554 0 R
/E (Thank You for the times heaven moved on my behalf. Thank You for every answered prayer, every divine intervention, every moment of grace that I did not deserve but that You gave freely and generously. You are faithful. Heaven moves when I pray. And I will spend the rest of my life praying with the confidence that comes from knowing exactly who is listening.)
/Pg 114 0 R
/K [4]
>>
